Com o WebView (feature `webview`), o app usa o navegador do sistema, que não vai no binário:
o runtime do Microsoft Edge WebView2 no Windows, o WKWebView no macOS e o WebKitGTK
(LGPL-2.1, https://webkitgtk.org) no Linux.
With the WebView (`webview` feature), the app uses the system browser engine, which is not
bundled: the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime on Windows, WKWebView on macOS and WebKitGTK
(LGPL-2.1, https://webkitgtk.org) on Linux.

A rede embutida (crates `tomni-ui-nebula` e `tomni-ui-netstack`) reimplementa em Rust o protocolo
do Nebula (https://github.com/slackhq/nebula, MIT, Copyright (c) 2018-2019 Slack Technologies,
Inc.), cujo desenho e partes do código foram portados; não há código Go nem binário do Nebula.
The embedded network (`tomni-ui-nebula` and `tomni-ui-netstack` crates) reimplements the Nebula
protocol (https://github.com/slackhq/nebula, MIT, Copyright (c) 2018-2019 Slack Technologies,
Inc.) in Rust; its design and parts of its code were ported, and no Go code or Nebula binary is
shipped.

O WireGuard embutido (crate `tomni-ui-wireguard`) reimplementa em Rust o protocolo do WireGuard
(wireguard-go, MIT, Copyright (C) 2017-2023 WireGuard LLC), e o Tailscale embutido (crate
`tomni-ui-tailscale`) reimplementa o cliente do Tailscale (https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale,
BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Tailscale Inc & AUTHORS); o desenho e partes do código foram
portados, e não há código Go nem binário deles. "WireGuard" é marca registrada de Jason A.
Donenfeld.
The embedded WireGuard (`tomni-ui-wireguard` crate) reimplements the WireGuard protocol in Rust
(wireguard-go, MIT, Copyright (C) 2017-2023 WireGuard LLC), and the embedded Tailscale
(`tomni-ui-tailscale` crate) reimplements the Tailscale client
(https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Tailscale Inc & AUTHORS);
their design and parts of their code were ported, and no Go code or binaries of them are
shipped. "WireGuard" is a registered trademark of Jason A. Donenfeld.
O ZeroTier embutido (crate `tomni-ui-zerotier`) reimplementa em Rust o protocolo do ZeroTier
(https://github.com/zerotier/ZeroTierOne, Copyright (c) ZeroTier, Inc.); o formato foi conferido
contra o ZeroTier 1.x, não há código C++ nem binário dele, e o arquivo `terra.planet` (a lista
pública das raízes) é distribuído sob a Mozilla Public License 2.0, sem alteração.
The embedded ZeroTier (`tomni-ui-zerotier` crate) reimplements the ZeroTier protocol in Rust
(https://github.com/zerotier/ZeroTierOne, Copyright (c) ZeroTier, Inc.); the format was checked
against ZeroTier 1.x, no C++ code or binary of it is shipped, and the `terra.planet` file (the
public list of roots) is distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, unmodified.

